nd="00:50.910">In </span><span begin="00:50.910" end="00:51.210">this </span><span begin="00:51.210" end="00:51.750">world </span><span begin="00:51.750" end="00:52.200">full </span><span begin="00:52.200" end="00:52.380">of </span><span begin="00:52.380" end="00:53.250">people </span><span begin="00:53.250" end="00:53.610">there's </span><span begin="00:53.610" end="00:53.880">one </span><span begin="00:53.880" end="00:54.480">killing </span><span begin="00:54.480" end="00:55.260">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.260" end="01:05.700"><span begin="00:55.260" end="00:55.500">And </span><span begin="00:55.500" end="00:55.740">if </span><span begin="00:55.740" end="00:56.130">we </span><span begin="00:56.130" end="00:56.580">only </span><span begin="00:56.580" end="00:57.240">die </span><span begin="00:57.240" end="00:58.710">once </span><span begin="00:58.710" end="00:59.070">I </span><span begin="00:59.070" end="00:59.610">wanna </span><span begin="00:59.610" end="01:00.240">die </span><span begin="01:00.240" end="01:00.630">with </span><span begin="01:00.630" end="01:01.230">you </span><span begin="01:01.230" end="01:01.230">（</span><span begin="01:01.230" end="01:02.400">you</span><span begin="01:02.400" end="01:02.400">, </span><span begin="01:02.400" end="01:03.540">you</span><span begin="01:03.540" end="01:03.570">, </span><span begin="01:03.570" end="01:05.670">you</span><span begin="01:05.670" end="01:05.700">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.700" end="01:09.450"><span begin="01:05.700" end="01:06.270">You </span><span begin="01:06.270" end="01:06.840">got </span><span begin="01:06.840" end="01:07.620">something </span><span begin="01:07.620" end="01:07.800">I </span><span begin="01:07.800" end="01:09.450">need</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.960" end="01:14.610"><span begin="01:09.960" end="01:10.290">In </span><span begin="01:10.290" end="01:10.620">this </span><span begin="01:10.620" end="01:11.130">world </span><span begin="01: